%% aoneahsan-cccs-nodejs — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Server-side or build-time work]) --> kind{What is it?}

    kind -->|a feature that seems<br/>to need a server| preflight{Zero-cost pre-flight}
    preflight --> q1{Client-side or free tier?}
    q1 -->|no| reject[REJECT the design.<br/>Find another shape]
    q1 -->|yes| q2{APIs free/keyless or<br/>origin-restricted?}
    q2 -->|no| reject
    q2 -->|yes| q3{No usage-based billing?}
    q3 -->|no| reject
    q3 -->|yes| browser{Can it run in<br/>the browser at all?}
    browser -->|yes| client[Build it client-side.<br/>Heavy work to a Web Worker]
    browser -->|no| pick{Which allowed backend?}
    pick -->|compute| cfw["Cloudflare Worker, free tier.<br/>Name: project-purpose<br/>Secrets: PROJECT_SECRETNAME"]
    pick -->|files or email| fh[FilesHub — never Firebase Storage,<br/>never an email SaaS or raw SMTP]
    pick -->|data| free[Firebase or Supabase free tier]

    kind -->|build step or<br/>release tool| noscripts{Is it a loose helper<br/>script?}
    noscripts -->|yes| forbidden[FORBIDDEN. No .sh/.py/.cjs files,<br/>no scripts/ folder.<br/>Run the command directly]
    noscripts -->|no, the build<br/>invokes it| tool[Allowed: program source wired into<br/>package.json, like postbuild-seo.ts]
    tool --> obligations[Docblock saying WHY it exists ·<br/>idempotent · fails loudly with the remedy ·<br/>exits non-zero on failure]

    kind -->|reading .env outside<br/>a bundler| envfix["process.loadEnvFile — no dotenv needed<br/>Node 20.12+"]
    envfix --> trap1[FIRST-WINS: list .env.local BEFORE .env<br/>so precedence matches the bundler]
    trap1 --> trap2[Throws ENOENT on a missing file —<br/>guard with existsSync]
    trap2 --> verify[Verify the RESOLVED value,<br/>not that the key exists.<br/>KEY= with no value looks configured]

    client --> done
    cfw --> done
    fh --> done
    free --> done
    obligations --> done
    forbidden --> done
    verify --> done
    done([Zero-cost, verified])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class kind,preflight,q1,q2,q3,browser,pick,noscripts gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class reject,forbidden warn
